## Project Overview

open-dpp is a TypeScript-based monorepo for creating, managing, validating, and presenting Digital Product Passports. It combines a NestJS API, a Vue 3 web client, shared type-safe packages, MongoDB persistence, S3-compatible object storage, authentication, real-time communication, AI integrations, and automated tests.

The repository uses pnpm workspaces and Turborepo to coordinate builds, development servers, tests, and documentation across applications and packages.

